        "item_ibeDMc": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What's the largest capacity custom power pack you can supply?",
            "content": "<p>The Sherpa PRO MK2 platform is available with up to 7,600Wh of onboard LiFePO4 battery storage and up to 12,000W continuous output. For larger requirements, multiple units can be linked. Tell us your load requirements in the notes field and we'll advise on the right configuration.</p>"
