          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I add solar and wind charging to the same unit?",
            "content": "<p>Yes - the PRO MK2 MPPT charge controller supports both solar and DC wind turbine input simultaneously. Select both options in the configurator and we'll ensure the input spec is matched to your panel and turbine setup.</p>"
