        "item_EERaYW": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How does generator auto-start work?",
            "content": "<p>The generator auto-start option adds a control link between your Sherpa unit and a compatible petrol or diesel generator. When onboard battery charge falls below a set threshold, the unit automatically signals the generator to start and replenish. This is ideal for unattended operation or sites where overnight discharge would otherwise be a problem.</p>"
          }
        },
